    skos:changeNote "0000-0001-5161-4801 Arjun Neyyathala created this resource"@en ;
    skos:definition "A method used to prepare supported catalysts in which a metal precursor solution is added to a support material in an amount exceeding the support’s pore volume, forming a slurry. The mixture is then stirred, and the solvent is subsequently removed through evaporation."@en ;
